### Test 1: Trigger Automated Azure Blob PDF Ingestion
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/autoIngestBlobPDF
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blobName": "Cocoa_Beans_Quality_SOP.pdf"
}

###

### Test 2: Verify Stored SOP Chunks
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/QualitySOPs?$select=fileName,sectionTitle,chunkText

###

### Test 3: Run RAG Grounded Anomaly Analysis
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/analyzeQualityAnomaly
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "EVT-9901",
  "ingredient": "Cocoa Beans",
  "moisturePercentage": 7.30,
  "temperatureCelsius": 23.0,
  "vendorId": "VEND-808"
}